OL,3,GNEWSATeenage biker killed in crash was
OL,4,A'deeply loved'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage biker who died in a crash in
OL,7,FAberdeenshire was "deeply loved",
OL,8,Frelatives have said.
OL,10,FKayden Thompson, 17, died after the
OL,11,Faccident on the B9031 Macduff to
OL,12,FFraserburgh road near Pennan at about
OL,13,F17:30 on Monday.
OL,15,FNo other vehicles were involved.
OL,17,FIn a statement, his family said: "We
OL,18,Fare devastated at the loss of our
OL,19,Fdeeply loved son, brother, grandson and
OL,20,Fnephew Kayden."
